      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "They'll probably get turned away at\r\nthe gate. I'd help, but as you can see—\r\nI'm swamped with work here.",
        "Jp" : "たぶん門前払いにあって入れないと思うんだ\r\n助けてやりたいんだが、わたしは見てのとおり――\r\nココの仕事が忙しくてさ"
